"miafina manetsika azy."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:100
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their"
" secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Ireo mpifandray azo itokisana dia afaka mangataka ny toerana misy anao "
"amin'ny alàlan'ny fandefasana hafatra SMS miafina. Ny TOTP dia tsy maintsy "
"atao mba hiasan'ity endri-javatra ity. Ampio ny mpifandray etsy ambany ary "
"apetraho ny fehezan-teny miafina manetsika azy. Modely ohatra: 'SECRET TOTP'"
" Ohatra amin'ny fiainana tena izy: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:103
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Ireo mpifandray azo itokisana dia afaka manetsika mangina ny antso amin'ny "
"alàlan'ny fandefasana hafatra SMS miafina. Ny TOTP dia tsy maintsy atao mba "
"hiasan'ity endri-javatra ity. Ampio ny mpifandray etsy ambany ary apetraho "
"ny fehezan-teny miafina manetsika azy. Modely ohatra: 'SECRET TOTP' Ohatra "
"amin'ny fiainana tena izy: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:106
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Ireo mpifandray azo itokisana dia afaka mandefa fampitana SMS. Ny TOTP dia "
"tsy maintsy atao mba hiasan'ity endri-javatra ity. Ampio ny mpifandray etsy "
"ambany ary apetraho ny fehezan-teny miafina manetsika azy. Modely ohatra: "
"'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 HAFATRA' Ohatra amin'ny fiainana tena izy: 'Gorilla"
" 123456 +1234567890 Hello'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:109
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Ireo mpifandray azo itokisana dia afaka manomboka fivoriana SSH tmate ary "
"mahazo ny tady fidirana SSH amin'ny alàlan'ny fandefasana hafatra SMS "
"miafina. Ny TOTP dia tsy maintsy atao mba hiasan'ity endri-javatra ity. "
"Ampio ny mpifandray etsy ambany ary apetraho ny fehezan-teny miafina "
"manetsika azy. Modely ohatra: 'SECRET TOTP' Ohatra amin'ny fiainana tena "
"izy: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:112
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can wipe your device. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to"
" work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Ireo mpifandray azo itokisana dia afaka mamafa ny fitaovanao. Ny TOTP dia "
"tsy maintsy atao mba hiasan'ity endri-javatra ity. Ampio ny mpifandray etsy "
"ambany ary apetraho ny fehezan-teny miafina manetsika azy. Modely ohatra: "
"'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Ohatra amin'ny "
"fiainana tena izy: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"

